bluejetty:00078484:ios.description:
Travel Tile is a special and fun triple puzzle casual game.
You just need to click and match three identical items, match all the tiles in the level, then you can win. You need to use your cleverness to pass the obstacles in the level to win. Each level has a different style. Exploring, discovering and solving level puzzles is both challenging and fun.
Game features:
- Dozens of different styles of tiles: there are various fruits, animals, toys and objects visible in life, each level can give you a refreshing feeling;
- Hundreds and thousands of levels: Don’t worry about running out of levels to play, there are enough levels to meet your needs;
- Fiercely competitive rankings: There are multiple rankings in the game to compete with players from all over the world for championship glory;
- Travel around the world: after passing the level, you can decorate various places. There are many world-famous scenic spots here, which can be decorated according to your style, and can also be set as your game background;
- Join a group: There is a group function in the game. Join a group to communicate with players around the world and win generous game rewards together;
- Fascinating collection: here you can also collect cards, and you will receive rewards for completing each album; various albums such as buildings, food, animals, etc. are already online, and more albums will be released in the future;
- Continuous activities: Rich activities are ongoing. There will be various holiday themed activities and daily activities, and the game content will be richer.
This game is the perfect choice for Match three lovers. Travel Tile is full of challenges and fun, but also has the characteristics of leisurely entertainment. Play triple tile match game levels and become a decoration master!

