bluejetty:00127197:ios.description:
Spectrum Analyzer is a pro audio tool with sound level meter, multichannel harmonic analysis and detailed graphical representation.
Learn something new about your sound environment with real-time analysis!
FEATURES:
- sound level meter;
- harmonic analyzer;
- adjustable graphics;
- AI-powered sound source analyzer.
SOUND LEVEL METER
- precise measurement of sound and noise level
- real-time results
HARMONIC ANALYZER
- multichannel FFT analysis;
- adjustable parameters;
- graphical representation.
ADJUSTABLE GRAPHICS
- various graphics and diagram types;
- zoom of selected chart areas.
This app offers subscriptions. The paid version includes AI noise detection, immersive 3D visualization, and customizable settings. The free version offers dB/Hz measurement, 2D mode, and limited visualization options.
Privacy Policy: https://musicbreath.com/privacy
Terms Of Use: https://musicbreath.com/tos

