bluejetty:00162161:ios.description:
Citrus is a Ukrainian online shop for tech, smartphones and gadgets. With the Citrus app you can shop smartphones, laptops, tablets, TVs, home appliances, accessories and personal electric transport online. A convenient store for personal electronics in your smartphone: catalog, deals, payment and delivery in one place.
What you can shop in the Citrus app
The Citrus catalog covers a broad selection of modern tech:
• smartphones and cases, including iPhone and certified refurbished popular models of iPhone from the Citrus Refurbished line;
• laptops, tablets, monitors and PCs;
• TVs, projectors, portable speakers and headphones;
• smart watches, fitness bands and other functional gadgets;
• gaming: consoles, gamepads, gaming chairs, gaming monitors, accessories;
• home appliances: refrigerators, washing machines, cookers, dishwashers, coffee machines, blenders, hair dryers;
• smart home products, robot vacuums and climate equipment;
• energy independence: power banks, portable power stations, generators and other power solutions;
• personal electric transport: electric scooters, kick scooters, bicycles, mopeds, monowheels;
• beauty and wellness: beauty gadgets for hair, personal care, grooming tech.
How the Citrus app works
The Citrus app makes shopping from your phone easy:
• a clear catalog by category and brand;
• search, filters and sorting by parameters and price;
• favorites, watchlist and notifications about new arrivals and price drops;
• side-by-side product comparison by technical specs;
• product reviews, ratings and detailed descriptions;
• cart and quick checkout;
• order and delivery tracking inside the app.
Payment and delivery
Choose convenient payment options: card online, on receipt or Citrus Dolky - instalments on eligible items. Delivery via Nova Poshta, Ukrposhta, courier or pickup from Citrus stores — pick whatever works for you.
Deals, bonuses and the Citrus loyalty program
The Citrus app gives you access to current deals, promo codes and the Plushki loyalty program: bonus points credited to your loyalty account that you can spend on future purchases. Subscribe to notifications so you don't miss new offers and arrivals.
Trade-in, service and official retailer status
Citrus is an official retailer with a broad assortment of tech, warranty and service. In the app you can trade in your old smartphone via the Citrus Trade-In program, review warranty and service terms, and book installation or setup through the Citrus Master service.
Citrus stores and pickup
In the app you can quickly find the nearest Citrus store, check stock and pick up your order in person. The offline network supports online shopping: hold the gadget in your hands before you buy.
Download the Citrus app to shop tech, smartphones, laptops, gadgets and accessories online.

